
<div class="light" style="width:1180px;height:1200px;background:var(--s0);color:var(--fg);padding:32px 36px">

  <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px">The small system underneath all three directions</div>
  <div style="color:var(--fg-2);max-width:820px;margin-bottom:26px">Two text sizes, four heights, three radii, one icon size, one accent with four jobs. Everything on the artboards is built out of exactly this &mdash; if something needs a fifth height or a third text size it is a sign the thing is doing two jobs.</div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 44px;align-items:start">

    <!-- ================= left column ================= -->
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px">

      <!-- type -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Type &mdash; two sizes, two weights</div>
        <div style="border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 190px;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline">
            <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px">Body &mdash; 13&nbsp;px / 20</div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">rows, cells, menus, buttons, rail labels</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 190px;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline">
            <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600">Body semibold &mdash; the only other weight</div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">active file, selected tab</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 190px;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:baseline">
            <div class="caps">Meta caps &mdash; 11&nbsp;px / 16</div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">column names, section labels</div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 190px;gap:12px;padding:12px 14px;align-items:baseline">
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">meta 11&nbsp;px &mdash; types, row numbers, hints, &#8984;P</div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">never smaller than this</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:8px">Today: 16, 13.6, 12, 11.56 px plus monaco's own &mdash; four sizes doing the work of two, because <span class="mono">--font-sm: 0.85em</span> compounds wherever it nests.</div>
      </div>

      <!-- heights -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Heights &mdash; four, and they stack</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px"><div class="row" style="width:210px;height:36px;background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;padding:0 10px;color:var(--fg-2)">rail</div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">36 px</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">every pane header, identically</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px"><div class="row" style="width:210px;height:30px;background:var(--s0);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:0 12px;color:var(--fg-2)">table row &amp; header</div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">30 px</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">was 28 &mdash; 2 px is the whole "looser"</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px"><div class="row" style="width:210px;height:26px;background:var(--s0);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:0 10px;color:var(--fg-2)">tree row</div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">26 px</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">hover fills the whole row</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px"><div class="row" style="width:210px;height:24px;background:var(--s2);border-radius:6px;padding:0 10px;color:var(--fg-2)">control</div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">24 px</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">chips, buttons, inputs inside a rail</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- space + radius -->
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
        <div>
          <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Space</div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px">
            <div class="row" style="gap:10px"><div style="width:6px;height:14px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.85"></div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">6 &mdash; icon to label</span></div>
            <div class="row" style="gap:10px"><div style="width:8px;height:14px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.85"></div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">8 &mdash; inside a control</span></div>
            <div class="row" style="gap:10px"><div style="width:12px;height:14px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.85"></div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">12 &mdash; rail and cell padding</span></div>
            <div class="row" style="gap:10px"><div style="width:16px;height:14px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.85"></div><span class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">16 &mdash; pane padding</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Radius</div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:12px;align-items:flex-end">
            <div style="text-align:center">
              <div style="width:56px;height:44px;background:var(--s2);border-radius:8px"></div>
              <div class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:6px">8 &mdash; panels</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:center">
              <div style="width:44px;height:30px;background:var(--s2);border-radius:6px"></div>
              <div class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:6px">6 &mdash; controls</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:center">
              <div style="width:30px;height:18px;background:var(--s2);border-radius:4px"></div>
              <div class="mono meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:6px">4 &mdash; kbd</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:10px">Nested, largest outside: a 6&nbsp;px chip never sits inside a 4&nbsp;px box. Today 3, 4 and 6 px are all in use, sometimes touching.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- icons -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Icons &mdash; 14 px, one weight, <span style="text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:400">always <span class="mono">--fg-3</span> until they mean something</span></div>
        <div class="row" style="gap:16px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;color:var(--fg-3)">
          <svg class="ic"><use href="#i-search"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-db"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-box"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-table"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-type"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-file"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-play"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-list"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-panel"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-dl"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-copy"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-x"/></svg><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-moon"/></svg>
          <span style="flex:1"></span>
          <svg class="ic" style="color:var(--accent)"><use href="#i-play"/></svg>
          <svg class="ic" style="color:var(--error)"><use href="#i-warn"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="row" style="gap:12px;margin-top:8px;padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;color:var(--fg-3)">
          <svg class="ic12"><use href="#i-right"/></svg><svg class="ic12"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>
          <span class="meta">12 px &mdash; the one exception: chevrons, which are pure direction and read heavy at 14</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:8px">Today: 12, 13, 14 and 16 px in the same row of chrome.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= right column ================= -->
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px">

      <!-- surfaces -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">Surfaces &mdash; one ramp that means the same thing in both themes</div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
          <div style="flex:1;background:#ffffff;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#1f2024">s0</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#8f9099">page</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#f7f7f8;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#1f2024">s1</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#8f9099">panes</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#eeeef1;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#1f2024">s2</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#8f9099">hover</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#e3e3e8;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#1f2024">s3</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#8f9099">pressed</div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:0;border:1px solid #3f3f44;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:-1px">
          <div style="flex:1;background:#1e1e1e;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#cfcfd2">s0</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#6e6e75">page</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#252527;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#cfcfd2">s1</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#6e6e75">panes</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#2e2e31;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#cfcfd2">s2</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#6e6e75">hover</div></div>
          <div style="flex:1;background:#3a3a3e;height:64px;padding:8px 10px"><div class="mono meta" style="color:#cfcfd2">s3</div><div class="mono meta" style="color:#6e6e75">pressed</div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-left:3px solid var(--warn);border-radius:6px;background:var(--s1)">
          <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-2);line-height:17px">Worth fixing while we are in here: today <span class="mono">--bg-1</span> is <em>darker</em> than <span class="mono">--bg-2</span> in light mode and <em>lighter</em> in dark, and <span class="mono">--border-dark</span> is the stronger line in light and the weaker one in dark. Both pairs swap meaning when the theme flips, so a component tuned in one theme is guessing in the other.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- accent -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">The accent has a budget &mdash; four jobs, no others</div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px">
          <div class="row" style="gap:10px;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px"><span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--accent-bg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent-line)"></span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-2)">selected cell / row</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:10px;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px"><span style="width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--accent-bg)"></span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-2)">focus ring</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:10px;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px"><span style="width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent)"><svg class="ic12"><use href="#i-play"/></svg></span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-2)">the running statement</span></div>
          <div class="row" style="gap:10px;height:36px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px"><span style="width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline">a</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-2)">links (Details &rarr; Trino UI)</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row" style="gap:10px;margin-top:10px">
          <span class="row" style="gap:7px;height:26px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--error-bg);color:var(--error)"><svg class="ic12"><use href="#i-warn"/></svg><span class="meta">failed &middot; cancelled</span></span>
          <span class="row" style="gap:7px;height:26px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg-2)"><span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok)"></span><span class="meta">finished</span></span>
          <span class="row" style="gap:7px;height:26px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--fg-2)"><span style="width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="meta">running</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- table lines -->
      <div>
        <div class="caps" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:10px">The single biggest de-squaring: drop the vertical rules</div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px">
          <div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:6px">now &mdash; every cell is a box</div>
            <div class="now-light" style="border:1px solid var(--border-dark);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-0);color:var(--text-0)">
              <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;font-size:13px">
                <tr><th style="width:36px;background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);height:34px"></th><th style="background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left;padding:0 6px"><div style="font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase">nation</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2)">varchar</div></th><th style="width:96px;background:var(--bg-1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-align:left;padding:0 6px"><div style="font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase">orders</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text-2)">bigint</div></th></tr>
                <tr><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;text-align:right;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">1</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">ARGENTINA</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">598412</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;text-align:right;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">2</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">BRAZIL</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">601077</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;font-size:11px;text-align:right;color:var(--text-2);background:var(--bg-1);border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">3</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-right:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">CANADA</td><td style="height:28px;padding:0 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">600288</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-bottom:6px">proposed &mdash; hairlines and alignment do it</div>
            <div style="border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--s0)">
              <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;table-layout:fixed;font-size:13px">
                <tr><th style="width:36px;background:var(--s1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-right:1px solid var(--line);height:30px"></th><th style="background:var(--s1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-right:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;padding:0 12px"><div class="row" style="gap:8px"><span class="caps" style="flex:1">nation</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">varchar</span></div></th><th style="width:96px;background:var(--s1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong);text-align:left;padding:0 12px"><div class="row" style="gap:8px"><span class="caps" style="flex:1">orders</span><span class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3)">bigint</span></div></th></tr>
                <tr><td class="meta num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">1</td><td style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">ARGENTINA</td><td class="num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">598412</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="meta num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">2</td><td style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">BRAZIL</td><td class="num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">601077</td></tr>
                <tr><td class="meta num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;color:var(--fg-3);background:var(--s1);border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">3</td><td style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">CANADA</td><td class="num" style="height:30px;padding:0 12px;text-align:right;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">600288</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" style="color:var(--fg-3);margin-top:10px;line-height:17px">Column tracking survives: the header keeps its separators, numerics are right-aligned and tabular, and the row-number gutter still anchors the left edge. Header goes to one line &mdash; name left, type right &mdash; which also buys back 10&nbsp;px.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
